User data (prefs, mods, saves) is now kept in
~/.local/share/dwarffortress/Bay 12 Games/Dwarf Fortress/
to avoid clashing with the Steam release. Old saves can be moved from
~/.local/share/Bay 12 Games/Dwarf Fortress/save/

If upgrading from version 51.x, old saves were stored in:
  ~/.local/share/dwarffortress/data/save/
